{'symbol': 'TXT', 'date': '2021-10-28 06:30:00', 'title': 'TEXTRON REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2021 RESULTS; RAISES FULL YEAR EPS AND CASH GUIDANCE', 'text': 'PROVIDENCE, R.I.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TEXTRON INC. (NYSE: TXT) TODAY REPORTED THIRD QUARTER 2021 INCOME FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $0.82 PER SHARE. ADJUSTED INCOME FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS, A NON-GAAP MEASURE THAT IS DEFINED AND RECONCILED TO GAAP IN AN ATTACHMENT TO THIS RELEASE, WAS $0.85 PER SHARE FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2021, COMPARED TO $0.53 PER SHARE IN THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2020. “IN THE QUARTER, WE SAW SOLID EXECUTION, HIGHER MANUFACTURING MARGIN AND CONTINUED STRONG CASH GENERATION,'}